      "side": 1,
      "message": "With disabling trimming we would discourage KMI symbol list updates. Downstream project would work though using potentially never allowed symbols. In that case we would defer KMI symbol list entry discussions to the very final phase when upstreaming changes to exported symbols are not as easy as earlier.\n\nWhat is your concern with trimming?",
